---
import GovLayout from '../../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
import PhaseBanner from '../../components/PhaseBanner.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import SummaryBox from '../../components/SummaryBox.astro';
import InsetText from '../../components/InsetText.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="Universal Basic Income" department="Ministry of Social Welfare" description="UBI payment rates, eligibility, and auto-repayment rules.">

<PhaseBanner tag="Policy" text="Published 24 March 2026" />
<Breadcrumbs items={[
  { label: "Social Welfare", href: "/welfare" },
  { label: "Universal Basic Income", href: "/welfare/ubi" },
]} />

<main class="govuk-main-wrapper">
  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
      <h1>Universal Basic Income</h1>

      <SummaryBox title="Summary">
        <p>Every online citizen receives a regular income payment from the government. The amount depends on activity level, driver experience, and government employment status.</p>
      </SummaryBox>

      <h2 id="rates">1. Payment Rates</h2>
      <p>UBI is distributed hourly to all online players:</p>

      <table class="govuk-table govuk-table--numeric">
        <caption>UBI Payment Schedule</caption>
        <thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Hourly Rate</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">Active player</td><td>$18,000</td><td style="text-align:left">Currently driving or doing activities</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">AFK player</td><td>$6,000</td><td style="text-align:left">Online but idle</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">Government employee (active)</td><td>$36,000</td><td style="text-align:left">2× standard UBI rate</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="text-align:left">Government employee (AFK)</td><td>$12,000</td><td style="text-align:left">2× AFK rate</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 id="scaling">2. Driver Level Scaling</h2>
      <p>UBI payments scale with the recipient's <strong>driver level</strong>. Higher-level drivers receive a larger payment, reflecting their greater contribution to the economy.</p>

      <InsetText>
        The exact scaling formula ensures that new players still receive a meaningful income, while experienced drivers earn proportionally more. This encourages continued progression.
      </InsetText>

      <h2 id="auto-repay">3. Loan Auto-Repayment</h2>
      <p>If a UBI recipient has an outstanding loan at Bank of ASEAN, a portion of their UBI payment is automatically applied to loan repayment before the remainder is deposited. This ensures that borrowed public funds are returned to the treasury.</p>

      <h2 id="frequency">4. Distribution Frequency</h2>
      <p>UBI runs as a <strong>scheduled task every 60 minutes</strong>. The system checks all online players and distributes payments in bulk. Payments are logged as <code>Government Funding: UBI</code> in the financial ledger.</p>

    </div>
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-one-third">
      <Sidebar items={[
        { label: "Payment Rates", href: "#rates" },
        { label: "Driver Level Scaling", href: "#scaling" },
        { label: "Loan Auto-Repayment", href: "#auto-repay" },
        { label: "Distribution Frequency", href: "#frequency" },
      ]} />
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</GovLayout>
